{"text":"She makes me very, very proud. And I'm sure I think that may be her. Is that somebody related to you? Because we just had a chance to meet, and she's beaming with pride right now sitting next to you. Give Neha a big round of applause once again. Distinguished guests, ladies and gentlemen, to all the students and young people who are here today, to the people of India watching and listening across this vast nation, I bring the friendship and the greetings of the American people. On behalf of myself and Michelle, thank you so much for welcoming us back to India.","words":[{"text":"She","start":0.92,"end":1.38},{"text":"makes","start":1.38,"end":1.58},{"text":"me","start":1.58,"end":1.82},{"text":"very","start":1.82,"end":2.06,"punct":","},{"text":"very","start":2.28,"end":2.28},{"text":"proud","start":2.28,"end":2.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":2.96,"end":2.96},{"text":"I'm","start":2.96,"end":3.18},{"text":"sure","start":3.18,"end":3.36},{"text":"I","start":3.36,"end":3.76},{"text":"think","start":3.76,"end":3.86},{"text":"that","start":3.86,"end":4.0},{"text":"may","start":4.0,"end":4.14},{"text":"be","start":4.14,"end":4.34},{"text":"her","start":4.34,"end":4.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"Is","start":6.34,"end":6.8},{"text":"that","start":6.8,"end":6.96},{"text":"somebody","start":6.96,"end":7.4},{"text":"related","start":7.4,"end":8.48},{"text":"to","start":8.48,"end":8.78},{"text":"you","start":8.78,"end":9.12,"punct":"?"},{"text":"Because","start":10.34,"end":10.62},{"text":"we","start":10.62,"end":10.96},{"text":"just","start":10.96,"end":11.12},{"text":"had","start":11.12,"end":11.28},{"text":"a","start":11.28,"end":11.42},{"text":"chance","start":11.42,"end":11.54},{"text":"to","start":11.54,"end":11.72},{"text":"meet","start":11.72,"end":11.92,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":12.02,"end":12.24},{"text":"she's","start":12.24,"end":12.74},{"text":"beaming","start":12.74,"end":12.98},{"text":"with","start":12.98,"end":13.18},{"text":"pride","start":1